      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On the basis of material evidence both oral and documentary and on hearing the submissions of learned counsel for both the parties, the Tribunal awarded total compensation of Rs.9,48,000/- and fastened the liability against the 2nd responde"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5e43ab7d21a440a8abf089be73e8e4ca_36",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "10. It is not in dispute that on 01.01.2018 when the claimant was proceeding on his Honda Unicorn Motor Cycle, he met with an accident, wherein the lorry dashed against the Motor Cycle of the claimant leading to the crush injuries to the le"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b4d7d5d55b7e4394809e78ec9739c998_37",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The fact remains that the claimant's left leg above the knee has been amputated."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c8f0ccea49a0458ba3d52e110fb7fa7d_38",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nNC: 2024:KHC:2619 11."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f90d344167e94fe08b14625f0f05800b_39",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Though the claimant has stated that he was earning monthly income of Rs.15,000/- working as Contract Labour in Lanco Industries at Srikalahasti, Andhra Pradesh, no documentary evidence has been placed in proof of the income."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d3a74641e47b4930af2987eec9cb4860_40",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Under such circumstances, when there is no proof of income,\nthe Tribunal ought to have relied on the chart of the High Court Legal Services Committee for computation of the income."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "095ac30122354740862e6ffe12914b32_41",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The chart prescribes the income of Rs.12,500/- for the accident year 2018, whereas the Tribunal has assessed the monthly income of Rs.9,000/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "25872b0519af47b88c806d527ad1abdc_42",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The same requires to be enhanced to Rs.12,500/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "226ef2b09ca74c1ab9fa98f645a3bfaf_43",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The claimant was aged 25 years as on the date of occurrence of accident and the appropriate multiplier being '18' it was correctly taken by the Tribunal, which does not call for interference."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "85101c49b3a540fe85b4d75aeb47c048_44",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Doctor PW.2 has adduced evidence, who has treated the claimant."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c3deb61c4c024e8fb6f8f84117cbeb42_45",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Doctor has assessed the permanent disability to an extent of 80% to the whole body."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "af7c3953922f4b4e9862d08879e3994e_46",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, the Tribunal on examining the evidence adduced by the Doctor, despite the evidence of the expert has reduced the disability to an extent of 20% to the whole body."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d8b29d5f8f7343c08f1cdb639a0e23de_49",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is a different matter that if the Doctor, who has adduced the evidence is not the treated Doctor, however,\nonce he is an Orthopedic Surgeon, the fact remains that there is an amputation of the left leg above the knee, that itself is suff"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5caf3eeac6e642a4bdb803c055787326_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the circumstances, the Tribunal is left with no other alternative, but to award future prospects in such cases."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "85ac4bfb371144e2bcf36d966026e79e_51",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "12. In the present case on hand, the Tribunal has awarded future prospects, considering the disability to be - 11 - NC: 2024:KHC:2619 20%."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e6ac567e487f40029ce75c9a5a6733f8_52",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence the 'loss of future earning capacity' due to disability would be by adding 40% towards future prospects i.e, Rs.5,000/- would come to Rs.12,500/- + 5000 =\nRs.17,500/- x 12 x 18 x 80% = Rs.30,24,000/- as against Rs.3,89,000/- awarded b"
    },
